            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Tamil for an accountant, then the Tamil for a clerk."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: பதவி உயர்வு",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பதவி உயர்வு — patavi uyarvu — \"a promotion\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "கடினமாக உழைத்ததால் அவளுக்குப் பதவி உயர்வு கிடைத்தது. kaṭiṉamāka uḻaittatāl avaḷukkup patavi uyarvu kiṭaittatu. She got a promotion because she worked hard."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Word for word \"a rise in post\": பதவி \"a post\" + உயர்வு \"a rise\". The person takes -க்கு: அவளுக்குப் பதவி உயர்வு (patavi uyarvu)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பதவி உயர்வு (patavi uyarvu) joins பதவி (patavi), \"a post\", borrowed from Sanskrit padavī, \"a path, a station\" (Monier-Williams), and the native உயர்வு (uyarvu), \"a rise\", from உயர் (uyar), \"to rise\" (DEDR 646)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "patavi uyarvu",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *patavi uyarvu*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "patavi uyarvu, once more",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *patavi uyarvu*, once more]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "kaṭiṉamāka uḻaittatāl avaḷukkup patavi uyarvu kiṭaittatu. — She got a promotion because she worked hard.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *kaṭiṉamāka uḻaittatāl avaḷukkup patavi uyarvu kiṭaittatu.* — She got a promotion because she worked hard.]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "RECALL",
