          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "லட்சியம் (laṭciyam) is borrowed from Sanskrit lakṣya, \"a mark, something aimed at\" (Monier-Williams). Tamil writes the Sanskrit kṣ as ட்ச and gives the noun -அம்."
            }
          ]
